('GRE_3','GRE_3_5835','decorum','dɪ''kɔrəm','dɪ''kɔːrəm','[n] 礼节， 礼貌','I was treated with decorum and respect throughout the investigation.  整个调查当中我受到了礼遇和尊重。'),
