('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_135','eating lunch','','','吃午饭','You practice it while eating lunch.  你一边吃午餐一边练习；'),
('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_136','reading a book','','','看书','I remember reading a book somewhere – it said that almost all of us are waiting for something.  我记得在哪里读过一本书--- 书上说我们大部分人都一直在等待着什么。'),
('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_137','listening to music','','','听音乐','We spent the winter and some of the spring in my room—never hers—missing tests, listening to music, looking out my window to comment on people who wouldn''t have given us a second thought.  我们整个冬天和春天的一段时间都是在我宿舍度过的——我们从不去她的房间——逃考，听音乐，在我房间探出头去，对那些压根不会注意到我们的人品头论足。'),
('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_138','keep','kip','kiːp','保持','You have to work hard to keep ahead in your class.  要想在全班保持成绩领先，你就必需努力学习。'),
('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_139','keep to the right','','','靠右','All vehicles should keep to the right.  车辆一律靠右走。'),
