('PEPXiaoXue5_2','PEPXiaoXue5_2_156','Spanish','''spænɪʃ','''spænɪʃ','西班牙的','First-year students may elect  French, Spanish, or German.  一年级学生可选修法语、西班牙语或德语。'),
