('PEPXiaoXue6_1','PEPXiaoXue6_1_60','Mid-Autumn Festival','','','中秋节','Thus informed, the people rose together on the designated day to overthrow the Yuan, and since that time mooncakes have become an integral part of the Mid-Autumn Festival.  后来，人们在八月十五那天集合起来推翻了元朝统治。 从那以后，月饼成为中秋节不可或缺的元素。'),
