('BeiShiGaoZhong_7','BeiShiGaoZhong_7_87','steward','''stuɚd','''stjuːəd','[n] 男乘务员','The steward placed him with three young women dressed like parrot Their hands were resting on the table, red speared at the tips.  列车乘务员让他，和三个打扮得,像鹦鹉的年轻女人，坐在一起,她们的嘴唇涂得红红的，手放在桌子上。'),
